scenario a cold start walks up to a usable fix
describe The ordinary case, and the one every other trace is a deviation from.
describe A receiver comes up knowing nothing, sees satellites before it can use
describe them, solves a poor fix and then a good one. Each stage is a different
describe answer and the interface says something different about each.

# Coordinates throughout this directory are synthetic and obviously nowhere:
# half a degree north, one degree east, in the Gulf of Guinea. No real location
# belonging to anybody appears in this repository.

# Two separate answers about the same moment, which is ADR-0011 §2's whole
# point. Validity says there is no position. Trust says how much the evidence
# argues against one — and "no fix, no satellites" is 35 against a degrade
# threshold of 30, so the trust axis is Degraded while the validity axis is
# NoFix. Neither is a restatement of the other, and an application that showed
# a single `quality` here would have to pick one and lose the other.
at 0
  fix none
  sats 0 0
  expect validity nofix
  expect trust degraded
  expect reason fix-lost
  expect reason insufficient-satellites

at 5000
  fix none
  sats 0 6
  expect validity nofix
  expect trust degraded
  expect reason fix-lost

# First solution: two-dimensional, so no altitude. A caveat, not a refusal.
at 21000
  fix 2d
  pos 5000000 10000000
  acc 42000
  sats 4 9
  hdop 640
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect validity degraded
  expect no-reason fix-lost
  expect no-reason insufficient-satellites   # four is the minimum, and it is enough
  # The evidence is gone and the state does not move yet. Down is immediate and
  # up is earned: the score has to stay clean for the recovery hold, which is
  # five seconds. The next step is six seconds later and that is where it goes.
  expect trust degraded

at 27000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000100 10000050
  alt 42000
  acc 28000
  sats 6 11
  hdop 310
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect validity degraded          # accuracy still outside the policy
  expect trust trusted

at 34000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000140 10000070
  alt 42500
  acc 4200
  sats 11 14
  hdop 90
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect validity valid
  expect trust trusted
